 urces\n→\n	 \n			Primary Care Plus (PCPlus) Open Office Hour for PCPlus 
 Practices\nPrimary Care Plus (PCPlus) Open Office Hour for PCPlus Practice
 s\nOct 09\, 2026\nThe Office of MaineCare Services (OMS) will hold a PCPlu
 s Open Office Hour on\nMonday\, October 19\, 2026\n\, from 12:00 PM - 1:00
  PM.\nThe Open Office Hour provides an accessible online venue for PCPlus 
 providers to ask OMS questions about the MaineCare program.\nTo attend thi
 s upcoming virtual meeting\, please\nregister via\nZoom\n.\nTo view other 
 Delivery System Reform technical assistance resources\, visit the\nDeliver
 y System Reform\nwebpage and click on the\nTechnical Assistance Calendar\n
 on the right side of the webpage. From the calendar you can click on the e
 vent you are interested in to access the registration link.\nhttps://www.m
